# Standard Library Architectural Audit: Generational Evolution Model (R2)

File: openOODA/audit/std_arch_generational.oot
Status: Certified Complete (R2 Generational Progression Model)

## 1. The 7-Tier Generational Computing Strata

The openOODA Generational Evolution Model (RULES.oot Section 1.6) organizes autonomous capability
into seven computational and physical tiers:

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                GENERATIONAL OODA COMPUTING STRATA                                │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ GEN 7: AUTONOMOUS RECURSIVE SELF-EVOLUTION (Swarm Kinematics, AST Genome, Open-Ended Growth)     │
│ GEN 6: META-COGNITIVE & SELF-REFLECTIVE (Attention Gating, Working Memory, CEGIS, Immune Superv) │
│ GEN 5: STRATEGIC & GAME-THEORETIC (Theory of Mind, Vickrey Auctions, BFT Consensus, Deception)  │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ ========================= AUTONOMIC REFLEX STRATUM BOUNDARY (tau <= 100 us) ==================== │
│ GEN 4: ADAPTIVE & LEARNING (Boyd E-M, Variable Geometry CADC, Bandit Exploration, SMT Provers)   │
│ GEN 3: PREDICTIVE & MODEL-BASED (Kalman Filter, MPC Receding Horizon, LQR Riccati, RK4 Integrator)│
│ GEN 2: STATE-AWARE & FEEDBACK (Closed-Loop PID, Anti-Windup, Cybernetic Homeostats, State Trees) │
│ GEN 1: REACTIVE & SILICON (AVX-512 SIMD, DH Kinematics, Pure Functional Invariants, Direct Rules)│
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

